~ douhave
Aristeo: Mayroon ka na bang liham?
- Mayroon na
	Aristeo: hmmmm... Maaari mo ba sa'kin ipakita?
	do wait(1)
	do ItemDetection.itemdetect(23)
	if ItemDetection.is_detected == true:
